INSERT INTO `tbl_content_management` VALUES (1,'terms_and_service','<p><strong>Trophy Talk Terms and Conditions</strong></p><p><strong>Effective Date:</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> 7/1/2025</span></p><p><strong>1. Acceptance of Terms</strong></p><p>By accessing or using the Trophy Talk app (“App”), website, or</p><p>any related services (collectively, “Services”), you agree to be</p><p>bound by these Terms and Conditions (“Terms”), our Privacy</p><p>Policy, and any community guidelines or rules we publish. If you</p><p>do not agree, do not use Trophy Talk.</p><p><strong>2. Eligibility</strong></p><p>You must be at least 18 years old and a legal resident of the</p><p>United States (excluding Florida, New York, Rhode Island, Puerto</p><p>Rico, and other U.S. territories) to use the Services. By using</p><p>Trophy Talk, you represent and warrant that you meet these</p><p>requirements.</p><p><strong>3. Account Registration and Security</strong></p><p>You may be required to create an account to use certain features.</p><p>You agree to:</p><p>• Provide accurate, current information.</p><p>• Keep your login credentials confidential.</p><p>• Notify us immediately of any unauthorized use of your</p><p>account.</p><p>You are responsible for all activity under your account.</p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">4. Community Guidelines and User Conduct</strong></p><p>Trophy Talk is a community for hunters to connect, share, and</p><p>engage respectfully. By using the Services, you agree:</p><p>• Not to post content that is illegal, hateful, harassing, violent,</p><p>sexually explicit, misleading, or otherwise violates our</p><p>community guidelines.</p><p>• Not to impersonate others or misrepresent your affiliation.</p><p>• Not to use the Services for commercial solicitation without</p><p>authorization.</p><p>• Not to attempt to access, tamper with, or use non-public</p><p>areas of the App or its systems.</p><p>We reserve the right to remove content or suspend accounts that</p><p>violate these rules or our community standards.</p><p><strong>5. User Content and Ownership</strong></p><p>You retain ownership of any content (photos, videos, text,</p><p>comments, etc.) you post on Trophy Talk (“User Content”). By</p><p>posting, you grant Trophy Talk a worldwide, royalty-free,</p><p>sublicensable license to use, display, reproduce, modify, adapt,</p><p>publish, and distribute your User Content in connection with the</p><p>Services and for promotional purposes.</p><p>You are responsible for your User Content and warrant that you</p><p>have all necessary rights to post it. We may remove or restrict</p><p>access to any content that violates these Terms or our policies.</p><p><strong>6. Intellectual Property</strong></p><p>All rights in the Trophy Talk platform, including logos, trademarks,</p><p>software, and content provided by Trophy Talk, are owned by OG</p><p>Trips, LLC DBA Trophy Talk or its licensors. You may not use,</p><p>copy, or distribute any part of the Services except as expressly</p><p>authorized by these Terms.</p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">7. Privacy</strong></p><p>Your use of Trophy Talk is subject to our Privacy Policy, which</p><p>explains how we collect, use, and protect your data. By using the</p><p>Services, you consent to these practices.</p><p><strong>8. Safety and Reporting</strong></p><p>We are committed to maintaining a safe environment. You agree</p><p>not to:</p><p>• Bully, harass, threaten, or intimidate others.</p><p>• Post content that depicts illegal or dangerous acts.</p><p>• Use the Services to promote or facilitate unlawful activity.</p><p>If you see behavior or content that violates these Terms, report it</p><p>to us immediately using in-app tools or by contacting [Insert</p><p>Contact Email].</p><p><strong>9. Marketplace, Sweepstakes, and Special Features</strong></p><p>Trophy Talk may offer additional features such as a marketplace,</p><p>sweepstakes, outfitter opportunities, and fractional ranch</p><p>ownership. These features are subject to their own rules and</p><p>eligibility requirements, which are available in-app and on our</p><p>website.</p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Apple and Google Disclosure:</strong> These features are not sponsored, endorsed,</p><p>or administered by Apple Inc. or Google Play.</p><p><strong>10. Payments</strong></p><p>If you make purchases (e.g., in the marketplace, for sweepstakes</p><p>entries), all payments are processed securely via Stripe. You</p><p>agree to pay all charges incurred by your account and to provide</p><p>accurate payment information.</p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">11. Termination</strong></p><p>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your account at any</p><p>time, for any reason, including violation of these Terms or our</p><p>policies. Upon termination, your right to use the Services will</p><p>cease immediately.</p><p><strong>12. Disclaimers and Limitation of Liability</strong></p><p>• Trophy Talk is provided “as is” and “as available,” without</p><p>warranties of any kind.</p><p>• To the fullest extent permitted by law, OG Trips, LLC DBA</p><p>Trophy Talk and its affiliates are not liable for any indirect,</p><p>incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use</p><p>of the Services.</p><p>• We do not guarantee the accuracy, completeness, or</p><p>reliability of any content or user interactions.</p><p><strong>13. Indemnification</strong></p><p>You agree to defend, indemnify, and hold harmless OG Trips, LLC</p><p>DBA Trophy Talk, its affiliates, and their employees, officers, and</p><p>agents from any claims, damages, or expenses arising from your</p><p>use of the Services or violation of these Terms.</p><p><strong>14. Modifications</strong></p><p>We may update these Terms at any time. We will notify users of</p><p>significant changes via the App or website. Continued use of the</p><p>Services after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the</p><p>new Terms.</p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">15. Governing Law</strong>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Colorado,</p><p>without regard to conflict of law principles. Any disputes shall be</p><p>resolved exclusively in the state or federal courts located in Weld</p><p>County, Colorado.</p><p><strong>16. Contact</strong></p><p>For questions or concerns, contact:</p><p>OG Trips, LLC DBA Trophy Talk</p><p>1881 Spring Bloom Dr., Windsor, CO 80550</p><p>Accounts@trophytalks.com</p><p><strong>Apple and Google Compliance Summary:</strong></p><p>• No purchase necessary for sweepstakes; free entry is</p><p>always available.</p><p>• Paid entries are optional and do not increase odds.</p><p>• Apple and Google are not involved in or responsible for any feature of this</p><p>App.</p><p>• User data is handled according to the Privacy Policy.</p><p>• Clear community guidelines and moderation practices are in</p><p>place.</p>','2025-06-11 06:37:21'),(2,'privacy_policy','<p><strong>Trophy Talk Privacy Policy</strong></p><p><strong>Effective Date:</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> 7/1/2025</span></p><p>This Privacy Policy explains how OG Trips, LLC DBA Trophy Talk (“Trophy Talk,” “we,” “us,” or “our”) collects, uses, discloses, and protects your information when you use our app, website, and related services (the “Services”).</p><p>By using Trophy Talk, you agree to the collection and use of your information as described in this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree, please do not use our Services.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>1. Information We Collect</strong></p><p><strong>a. Information You Provide</strong></p><ul><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Account Information:</strong>&nbsp;When you sign up, we collect your name, email, username, password, and other registration details.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Profile Details:</strong>&nbsp;You may add a photo, bio, location, and other info to your profile.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">User Content:</strong>&nbsp;We collect content you upload, post, or share (photos, videos, comments, messages, etc.).</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Sweepstakes &amp; Marketplace:</strong>&nbsp;If you participate in sweepstakes or make purchases, we collect transaction details and shipping information.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Customer Support:</strong>&nbsp;If you contact us, we collect the information you provide.</li></ul><p><strong>b. Information We Collect Automatically</strong></p><ul><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Usage Data:</strong>&nbsp;We collect details about your activity on the app (e.g., pages viewed, interactions, features used).</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Device Information:</strong>&nbsp;We collect device type, operating system, unique device identifiers, IP address, and mobile network information.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Location Data:</strong>&nbsp;With your permission, we may collect and process information about your precise or approximate location.</li></ul><p><strong>c. Information from Third Parties</strong></p><ul><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Payments:</strong>&nbsp;If you make purchases, payment information is processed securely by Stripe. We do not store your credit card details.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Social Media:</strong>&nbsp;If you link or interact with third-party accounts, we may receive certain information as permitted by those services.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>2. How We Use Your Information</strong></p><p>We use your information to:</p><ul><li>Provide, maintain, and improve the Trophy Talk Services and features.</li><li>Personalize your experience and show relevant content.</li><li>Facilitate social interactions, connections, and community engagement.</li><li>Process sweepstakes entries, select winners, and deliver prizes.</li><li>Process marketplace transactions and facilitate payments.</li><li>Communicate with you about your account, updates, and promotional offers.</li><li>Monitor and enforce our community guidelines and Terms of Service.</li><li>Ensure the security and integrity of our Services.</li><li>Comply with legal obligations and resolve disputes.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>3. Sharing of Your Information</strong></p><p>We may share your information with:</p><ul><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Service Providers:</strong>&nbsp;Companies that help us operate, such as hosting, analytics, customer support, and payment processing partners (e.g., Stripe).</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Other Users:</strong>&nbsp;Content you post is visible to other users and may be shared within the Trophy Talk community.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Legal Compliance:</strong>&nbsp;Authorities or third parties when required by law, regulation, legal process, or to protect the rights, property, or safety of Trophy Talk, our users, or others.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Business Transfers:</strong>&nbsp;In the event of a merger, acquisition, or asset sale, your information may be transferred as part of that transaction.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">With Your Consent:</strong>&nbsp;We may share information for other purposes if you consent or direct us to do so.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>4. Your Choices</strong></p><ul><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Profile and Content:</strong>&nbsp;You can update, edit, or delete your profile information and content at any time via the app settings.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Notifications:</strong>&nbsp;You can manage your notification preferences in the app.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Location Services:</strong>&nbsp;You can enable or disable location sharing through your device settings.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Sweepstakes Participation:</strong>&nbsp;Participation is always optional and you may opt out at any time.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>5. Data Security</strong></p><p>We use industry-standard security measures to protect your information, including encryption and secure servers. However, no method of transmission or storage is 100% secure. We encourage you to use strong passwords and to protect your account credentials.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>6. Data Retention</strong></p><p>We retain your information for as long as your account is active or as needed to provide the Services, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements. You may request account deletion at any time.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>7. Children’s Privacy</strong></p><p>Trophy Talk is not intended for children under 18. We do not knowingly collect personal information from individuals under 18. If we learn that we have collected such information, we will promptly delete it.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>8. International Users</strong></p><p>Trophy Talk is intended for users in the United States. If you access the Services from outside the U.S., you consent to the transfer, storage, and processing of your information in the U.S.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>9. Third-Party Links and Services</strong></p><p>Our Services may contain links to third-party websites or services not controlled by Trophy Talk. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those third parties. Please review their policies before providing any information.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>10. Your California Privacy Rights</strong></p><p>If you are a California resident, you may have certain rights under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA). Please contact us for more information or to exercise your rights.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>11. Apple App Store Disclosure</strong></p><p>Trophy Talk, its sweepstakes, and other features are <strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">not sponsored, endorsed, or administered by Apple Inc.</strong> Apple does not collect, process, or have access to your data through this app.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>12. Changes to This Policy</strong></p><p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of significant changes by posting the new policy in the app or on our website. Continued use of the Services after changes constitute acceptance of the updated policy.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>13. Contact Us</strong></p><p>If you have questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact:</p><p>OG Trips, LLC DBA Trophy Talk</p><p>1881 Spring Bloom Dr., Windsor, CO 80550</p><p>accounts@trophytalk.com</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Summary of Key Points for Apple, Google and Users:</strong></p><ul><li>We collect only what’s needed for your account, social features, sweepstakes, and marketplace.</li><li>Your data is protected with strong security measures.</li><li>You control your profile, content, and notification settings.</li><li>Free entry to sweepstakes is always available; Apple is not involved in any sweepstakes or promotions.</li><li>We do not sell your personal information.</li></ul>','2025-06-11 06:37:21'),(3,'seller_agreement','<p><strong>Trophy Talk Seller Agreement</strong></p><p><strong>Effective Date:</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> 7/1/2025</span></p><p>This Seller Agreement (“Agreement”) is entered into by and between OG Trips, LLC DBA Trophy Talk (“Trophy Talk,” “we,” “us,” or “our”) and the individual or business entity (“Seller,” “you,” or “your”) registering to sell products or services on the Trophy Talk platform (“Platform”).</p><p>By applying for and using the Trophy Talk Platform as a seller, you agree to the terms of this Agreement, our Terms and Conditions, Privacy Policy, and any additional policies referenced herein.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>1. Seller Onboarding &amp; Verification</strong></p><ul><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Application &amp; Vetting:</strong></li><li>Before approval, you must submit a complete application and provide all required documentation (including business credentials, tax information, and product details). Trophy Talk will review and vet all sellers and outfitters, and reserves the right to approve or deny applications at its sole discretion.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Ongoing Compliance:</strong></li><li>You agree to provide accurate, up-to-date information and to promptly notify Trophy Talk of any changes.</li></ul><p><strong>2. Use of Platform</strong></p><ul><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Account Security:</strong></li><li>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account and for all activity conducted under your account.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Content Standards:</strong></li><li>All listings must comply with Trophy Talk’s content guidelines and community standards. Prohibited items, misleading descriptions, or any content violating laws or platform rules may result in suspension or removal.</li></ul><p><strong>3. Fees &amp; Payment Terms</strong></p><ul><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Standard Commission:</strong></li><li>All sellers are subject to a standard commission rate of 15% on each completed sale. This commission is deducted automatically from the sale proceeds.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Payment Processing:</strong></li><li>All transactions are processed securely via Stripe. Sellers must provide and maintain valid payment and tax information.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Payouts:</strong></li><li>Net proceeds (after commission) will be paid out to your designated account according to the payout schedule shown in your seller dashboard.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Fee Changes:</strong></li><li>Trophy Talk reserves the right to update fee structures with at least 30 days’ notice.</li></ul><p><strong>4. Seller Obligations</strong></p><ul><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Product Quality &amp; Fulfillment:</strong></li><li>You agree to accurately describe your products/services, maintain inventory, fulfill orders promptly, and provide high-quality customer service.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Compliance:</strong></li><li>You are solely responsible for complying with all applicable laws, regulations, and industry standards (including but not limited to hunting regulations, product safety, and tax obligations).</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Returns &amp; Refunds:</strong></li><li>You must honor Trophy Talk’s return and refund policies, as communicated to buyers and detailed in the seller dashboard.</li></ul><p><strong>5. Prohibited Activities</strong></p><p>You may not:</p><ul><li>List, sell, or promote illegal, counterfeit, or prohibited items.</li><li>Manipulate sales, feedback, or reviews.</li><li>Engage in fraudulent, deceptive, or abusive conduct.</li><li>Circumvent platform fees or attempt off-platform transactions.</li></ul><p><strong>6. Intellectual Property</strong></p><p>You grant Trophy Talk a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free license to use your business name, trademarks, and product images for marketing and operational purposes. You represent that you own or have the right to use all intellectual property associated with your listings.</p><p><strong>7. Data Privacy &amp; Security</strong></p><ul><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Seller Data:</strong></li><li>Your information will be handled in accordance with our Privacy Policy.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Buyer Data:</strong></li><li>You may only use buyer information for order fulfillment and may not use it for unsolicited communications or any purpose not expressly permitted by Trophy Talk policies.</li></ul><p><strong>8. Suspension &amp; Termination</strong></p><ul><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Suspension:</strong></li><li>Trophy Talk may suspend or terminate your account for violation of this Agreement, our policies, or applicable law.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Termination:</strong></li><li>You may terminate this Agreement at any time by providing written notice and ceasing use of the Platform. Obligations for pending orders, returns, and outstanding payments shall survive termination.</li></ul><p><strong>9. Limitation of Liability</strong></p><p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, Trophy Talk is not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of the Platform. Trophy Talk’s aggregate liability is limited to the amount of fees paid by you in the preceding 12 months.</p><p><strong>10. Indemnification</strong></p><p>You agree to defend, indemnify, and hold harmless Trophy Talk, its affiliates, and their employees and agents from any claims, losses, or expenses arising from your listings, sales, or breach of this Agreement.</p><p><strong>11. Apple and Google App Store Compliance</strong></p><p>You acknowledge that:</p><ul><li>Trophy Talk is solely responsible for the operation of the Platform.</li><li>Apple Inc. and Google Play are not a party to this Agreement, nor does it sponsor, endorse, or administer any aspect of the Platform.</li><li>All app-based transactions and content must comply with Apple’s and Google Play App Store policies.</li></ul><p><strong>12. Modifications</strong></p><p>Trophy Talk may update this Agreement at any time. Notice of material changes will be provided via the Platform or email. Continued use of the Platform constitutes acceptance of the updated Agreement.</p><p><strong>13. Governing Law</strong></p><p>This Agreement is governed by the laws of the State of Colorado, without regard to conflict of law principles. Any disputes shall be resolved exclusively in the state or federal courts located in Weld County, Colorado.</p><p><strong>14. Contact</strong></p><p>For questions or concerns, contact:</p><p>OG Trips, LLC DBA Trophy Talk</p><p>1881 Spring Bloom Dr., Windsor, CO 80550</p><p>accounts@trophytalks.com</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Points for Sellers:</strong></p><ul><li>Standard 15% commission on all sales.</li><li>Sellers must be vetted and approved.</li><li>All transactions run through Stripe.</li><li>Sellers are responsible for legal compliance and product quality.</li><li>Apple and Google Play is not affiliated with or responsible for the Trophy Talk platform.</li><li>Data privacy, user safety, and platform integrity are top priorities.</li></ul>','2025-06-11 06:37:21'),(4,'sweepstacks_agreements','<p><strong>Trophy Talk Sweepstakes Official Rules</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>1. INTRODUCTION.</strong></p><p>While some sweepstakes may be designed to promote membership, that is not the case with these sweepstakes (the “Sweepstakes”). Membership is not a condition or requirement to participation in these Sweepstakes, nor will membership improve your chances of winning. One need not be a member to participate. This document also describes a customer loyalty program. Again, participation in this customer loyalty program is not a requirement to participate in the Sweepstakes, nor will participation in the loyalty program necessarily increase your chances of winning. As explained further below, one need not participate in the customer loyalty program to participate in the Sweepstakes.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>2. APPLE and GOOGLE PLAY DISCLOSURE.</strong></p><p>These Sweepstakes are in no way sponsored, endorsed, administered by, or associated with Apple Inc. or Google Play By participating, you acknowledge that Apple or Google bears no responsibility or liability for the administration, conduct, or fulfillment of the Sweepstakes.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>3. BINDING RULES.</strong></p><p>Sponsor will conduct the Sweepstakes substantially as described in these Official Sweepstakes Rules (the “Rules”). Your submission of an entry in the Sweepstakes constitutes your agreement to be bound by these Rules, as interpreted by Sponsor in its sole discretion. A failure to comply with these Rules will disqualify your participation in the Sweepstakes and void any entries submitted by you. These Sweepstakes are void where prohibited by law.</p><p><strong>4. SPONSOR.</strong></p><p>OG Trips, LLC DBA Trophy Talk is the sponsor of these Sweepstakes (“Sponsor”). Address: 1881 Spring Bloom Dr., Windsor, CO 80550.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>5. ELIGIBILITY.</strong></p><p>Only individuals who are 18 years of age or older and who are legal residents of the United States of America and the District of Columbia, but excluding Florida, New York, and Rhode Island, and also excluding Puerto Rico and other U.S. territories, are eligible to participate in these Sweepstakes. Residents of the state of Washington may participate in these Sweepstakes as a “promotional contest of chance” provided the participation is entirely off-line, without use of the internet, and the Sweepstakes are held out-of-state. Canadian residents are not eligible to participate. Also excluded from eligibility are any employees, members, managers, and officers of Sponsor and their immediate family members (spouse, parents, siblings, and children) and/or those living in the same household of such individuals. No purchase necessary to participate.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>6. HOW TO ENTER.</strong></p><ul><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Free Entry:</strong>&nbsp;No purchase or payment is necessary to enter or win. To enter for free, tap the “Free Entry” button on the sweepstakes page within the Trophy Talk app and complete the entry form. Limit one free entry per person per sweepstakes.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Paid Entry (Optional):</strong>&nbsp;Additional entries may be purchased within the Trophy Talk app using Stripe or other designated payment processors. The purchase of entries is strictly optional and does not increase your odds of winning compared to free entries. The maximum number of entries per person per sweepstakes is seventy-five (75), regardless of entry method.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(14, 18, 29);\">Equal Chance:</strong>&nbsp;All entries, whether free or paid, have an equal chance of winning.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>7. MAXIMUM NUMBER OF ENTRIES.</strong></p><p>You are limited to a maximum of seventy-five (75) entries per Prize offering, regardless of whether the entries are submitted automatically on your behalf by virtue of your participation in the Customer Loyalty Program, are submitted by the in-app free entry method, are purchased in-app via Stripe, or are submitted by any alternative entry method. Any entries that would cause you to exceed the maximum of 75 entries per Prize will be deemed void and disregarded for purposes of this Sweepstakes.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>8. WARNING AGAINST TAMPERING.</strong></p><p>ANY ATTEMPT BY ANY PERSON, WHETHER OR NOT AN ENTRANT, TO DELIBERATELY DAMAGE, DESTROY, TAMPER WITH, OR VANDALIZE ANY SPONSOR-OWNED WEBSITE OR MOBILE APPLICATION OR RELATED SOCIAL MEDIA SITE, THE ENTRY PROCESS, OR OTHERWISE INTERFERE WITH OR UNDERMINE THE LEGITIMATE OPERATION OF THE SWEEPSTAKES, MAY BE A VIOLATION OF CRIMINAL AND CIVIL LAWS, AND SPONSOR RESERVES THE RIGHT TO SEEK DAMAGES AND DILIGENTLY PURSUE ALL REMEDIES AGAINST ANY SUCH PERSON TO THE FULLEST EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW. SPONSOR RESERVES THE RIGHT, IN ITS SOLE DISCRETION, TO VOID ANY AND ALL ENTRIES OF ANY ENTRANT WHO SPONSOR BELIEVES HAS ATTEMPTED TO TAMPER WITH OR IMPAIR THE ADMINISTRATION, SECURITY, FAIRNESS, OR PROPER PLAY OF THESE SWEEPSTAKES. IN ADDITION, IF SPONSOR DETERMINES, IN ITS SOLE DISCRETION, THAT THE INTEGRITY AND SECURITY OF THESE SWEEPSTAKES HAS BEEN COMPROMISED, SPONSOR MAY SUSPEND OR CANCEL THESE SWEEPSTAKES OR MODIFY THE RULES AS IT DEEMS FAIR AND APPROPRIATE UNDER THE CIRCUMSTANCES.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>9. ENTRY PERIOD.</strong></p><p>The entry period for these Sweepstakes is available on Sponsor’s app. Each Prize may commence and end on a different date and time. Entries received by Sponsor outside of the entry period are void. No purchase is necessary to enter or win. A purchase does not necessarily increase your chances of winning, as any eligible participant may submit the maximum number of permissible entries through the free in-app method.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>10. PRIZES.</strong></p><p>A description of each prize (“Prize”) and its approximate retail value (“ARV”) is attached to and made a part of these Rules. Prizes may include hunting trips for Yukon moose, sheep, caribou, and/or hunting gear from partners. The depiction of the Prizes in any advertising or promotional materials may not reflect the actual Prizes delivered to the winners. All prizes are awarded on an “as is” basis without any representations or warranties other than those expressly set forth herein. Sponsor may, at its discretion, substitute a Prize of equal or greater value.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>11. DRAWING AND AWARD.</strong></p><p>The potential winner(s) of the Sweepstakes will be selected at random via the Trophy Talk admin panel within thirty (30) days of the close of the entry period or when the maximum amount of entries are sold out. A list of these potential winners will be published on the Trophy Talk App. The winner will be awarded one (1) Prize for each drawing. Sponsor will attempt in good faith to award an alternate Prize of equal or greater value where the nature of the Prize would prohibit its award by operation of law. A potential winner will be deemed to have forfeited a Prize if the winner (a) fails to comply with these Rules, (b) is determined to be ineligible by Sponsor, (c) declines to accept the Prize, or (d) cannot be contacted by Sponsor after Sponsor’s reasonable efforts and attempts to do so. In any such case, Sponsor may, in its discretion, award the Prize to an alternate entrant. To qualify as an official winner, and to receive the Prize, a potential winner is required to timely submit to Sponsor all such forms, documents, and information as Sponsor may require, including without limitation confirmation of eligibility, appropriate releases, and pertinent tax documentation. Potential winners may also be required to satisfy any outfitting organization’s safety or other requirements. Official winners will receive written confirmation of the award and be advised on the process for claiming the Prize.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>12. ODDS OF WINNING.</strong></p><p>Your odds of winning the Sweepstakes will depend on the number of eligible entries received by Sponsor. The purchase of a loyalty ticket or any paid entry is not a requirement to participate and does not improve your chances of winning, as any eligible participant may submit the maximum number of permissible entries through the free in-app method. No purchase is necessary to win.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>13. TAXES AND EXPENSES.</strong></p><p>Except as expressly provided in the Prize description, all taxes, fees, costs, and expenses associated with the receipt and use of any Prize shall be the sole responsibility of the winners. Such expenses may include travel and transportation costs. Winners will be issued an IRS Form 1099.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>14. TRANSFERABILITY OF PRIZES.</strong></p><p>Prizes are transferable, provided that written notice of such transfer is provided to Sponsor and that Sponsor is provided all such documentation as it may reasonably require in order to implement such a transfer, including without limitation verification of eligibility, signed releases and consents, and a completed IRS Form W-9. Notwithstanding any transfer of the prize, the transferor will remain responsible for any tax incurred as a result of having been awarded the prize. Prizes are not redeemable for cash.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>15. DISCLAIMER.</strong></p><p>Sponsor disclaims all liability arising out of or relating to technological or communications errors, failures, or malfunctions associated with the conduct and operation of the Sweepstakes.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>16. FORCE MAJEURE.</strong></p><p>Sponsor shall not be liable or responsible for any failure or delay in fulfilling or performing any term of these Sweepstakes when and to the extent such failure or delay is caused by or results from acts or circumstances beyond the control of Sponsor, and Sponsor’s obligations hereunder shall be suspended during periods in which there exists a force majeure event. A force majeure event is hereby defined as any event beyond the control of Sponsor, including without limitation, acts of God, natural catastrophes, fire, flood, hurricanes, tornados, volcanic activity, earthquakes, explosions, governmental actions, war, invasion or hostilities (whether war is declared or not), insurrections, terrorist threats or acts, riots, or other civil unrest, labor strikes, quarantines, national emergency, epidemics, and viral pandemics. If any such force majeure event shall continue for a period of more than sixty (60) days, Sponsor may, in its sole and absolute discretion, terminate this Sweepstakes without liability to you or any other person participating in the Sweepstakes.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>17. RELEASE AND COVENANT NOT TO SUE.</strong></p><p>BY PARTICIPATING IN THESE SWEEPSTAKES, YOU HEREBY AGREE TO FOREVER RELEASE THE RELEASED PARTIES (AS DEFINED BELOW) FROM, AND COVENANT NOT TO SUE THE RELEASED PARTIES, FOR ANY AND ALL LIABILITY, CLAIMS, CAUSES OF ACTION, LOSSES, OR DAMAGES, INCLUDING COSTS AND ATTORNEYS’ FEES, ARISING OUT OF OR RELATING IN ANY WAY TO YOUR PARTICIPATION IN THESE SWEEPSTAKES OR FROM THE ACCEPTANCE OR USE OF THE PRIZE. FOR PURPOSES OF THESE RULES, THE “RELEASED PARTIES” SHALL MEAN THE SPONSOR AND ITS MEMBERS, MANAGERS, EMPLOYEES, AGENTS, REPRESENTATIVES, SUCCESSORS, AND ASSIGNS. YOU HEREBY FURTHER AGREE THAT YOU WILL NOT SEEK TO OBTAIN, AND WAIVE ALL RIGHTS TO, ANY SPECIAL, PUNITIVE, EXEMPLARY, INCIDENTAL, CONSEQUENTIAL OR ANY OTHER DAMAGES (OTHER THAN ACTUAL OUT-OF-POCKET EXPENSES) FROM THE RELEASED PARTIES. THIS RELEASE AND COVENANT NOT TO SUE SHALL BE CONSTRUED BROADLY AND LIBERALLY IN FAVOR OF AND FOR THE PROTECTION OF THE RELEASED PARTIES.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>18. LICENSE.</strong></p><p>By participating in these Sweepstakes, you hereby grant to Sponsor and its licensees a perpetual, worldwide, royalty-free license to use your name, address, photograph or other likeness, voice, statements, or any other personally identifiable information for any and all marketing, promotional, or other legitimate business purposes. Subject to the foregoing and applicable law, all personal information collected by Sponsor in connection with these Sweepstakes will be subject to Sponsor’s Privacy Policy, which is hereby incorporated by reference into these Rules. A copy of this Privacy Policy may be found on Trophy Talk App.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>19. GOVERNING LAW.</strong></p><p>Any disputes relating to these Sweepstakes or these Rules shall be governed by, and construed in accordance with, the laws of the State of Colorado, without regard to conflicts of law principles. Your participation in these Sweepstakes shall be deemed as giving consent to the jurisdiction and venue of the federal and state courts located in Weld County.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>20. INFORMATION.</strong></p><p>For a copy of these Rules, please send a self-addressed stamped envelope to: OG Trips, LLC DBA Trophy Talk Sweepstakes – Rules Request, 1881 Spring Bloom Dr., Windsor, CO 80550.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Apple and Google Play App Store Compliance Highlights:</strong></p><ul><li>No purchase necessary; free entry is clear and accessible in-app.</li><li>Paid entries are optional and do not increase odds.</li><li>All odds, rules, and eligibility are transparent and in-app.</li><li>No gambling or raffle language.</li><li>Sweepstakes administration and winner selection are random and fair, using the Trophy Talk admin panel.</li><li>All user data is protected per Trophy Talk’s privacy policy.</li><li><strong>Apple or Google Play is not a sponsor, endorser, or administrator of this Sweepstakes.</strong></li></ul>','2025-06-11 06:37:21');
